{"title":"Mateo’s Project","puid":"c-nateng-3-gb/ddbot7","path":"/../c-nateng-3-gb/topic-02a-reading-comprehension-non-fiction/block-10-non-fiction-10/level-07","type":"normal","keyboardLayout":"standardNATENG","voiceLang":"en","voice":"f3_2025","instruction":{"voice":"m2_2025","speaker":true,"autoplay":true},"trainers":[{"trainer":"content","instruction":{"text":""},"textAlign":"left","atoms":[{"lsg":{"lsg":"/../c-nateng-3-gb/topic-02a-reading-comprehension-non-fiction/block-10-non-fiction-10/lsg/mateo.lsg"}},{"text":"Hi, I’m Mateo. My teacher, Mr Ozaki, is teaching us all about food groups and wants us to choose a food to write about. I think I want to write about fruit.","speaker":true,"voice":"m6","autoplay":true},{"button":"Continue"},{"lsg":{"lsg":"/../c-nateng-3-gb/topic-02a-reading-comprehension-non-fiction/block-10-non-fiction-10/lsg/fruitsbook.lsg"}},{"text":"Mr Ozaki gave me a book about different fruits to help me with my project. I wonder if there is information on pineapples in the book. They’re my favourite!","speaker":true,"voice":"m6","autoplay":true}]},{"trainer":"gapMulti","gapMode":"buttons","lsg":{"lsg":"/../c-nateng-3-gb/topic-02a-reading-comprehension-non-fiction/block-10-non-fiction-10/lsg/fruitindex.lsg","width":400},"design":"dialogue","soundMode":"b","textAlign":"left","finishButton":false,"atoms":{"b":"Let’s look at the <b>index</b> and see what we can find.","voice":"m6","person":{"lsg":"/../c-nateng-3-gb/topic-02a-reading-comprehension-non-fiction/block-10-non-fiction-10/lsg/mateo.lsg"}}},{"trainer":"buttons","instruction":{"text":""},"soundMode":"a","onSamePage":true,"shuffleButtons":true,"atoms":[{"a":"In which section can you find information about pineapples?","b":"++tropical_fruit stone_fruit tree_fruit"},{"a":"How many pages are about tropical fruit?","b":"++7 9 5"},{"a":"On which page can you find information about pineapples?","b":"++54 18 63"}]},{"trainer":"gapMulti","gapMode":"buttons","design":"dialogue","soundMode":"b","textAlign":"left","onSamePage":true,"finishButton":false,"atoms":{"b":"Look, there’s the information about pineapples! Let’s turn to page 54.","voice":"m6","person":{"lsg":"/../c-nateng-3-gb/topic-02a-reading-comprehension-non-fiction/block-10-non-fiction-10/lsg/mateo.lsg"}}},{"trainer":"dragAndValidate","instruction":{"text":"Drag the correct <b>subheadings</b> above the <b>subsections</b>.","speaker":true},"lsg":{"lsg":"/../c-nateng-3-gb/topic-02a-reading-comprehension-non-fiction/block-10-non-fiction-10/lsg/pineappletextsubheadings.lsg","width":400},"soundMode":"a","validateMode":"group","shuffleAtoms":true,"atoms":[{"b":{"zone":"z1"},"lsg":{"lsg":"/../c-nateng-3-gb/topic-02a-reading-comprehension-non-fiction/block-10-non-fiction-10/lsg/subheadingpineapple1.lsg","width":135}},{"b":{"zone":"z2"},"lsg":{"lsg":"/../c-nateng-3-gb/topic-02a-reading-comprehension-non-fiction/block-10-non-fiction-10/lsg/subheadingpineapple2.lsg","width":135}},{"b":{"zone":""},"lsg":{"lsg":"/../c-nateng-3-gb/topic-02a-reading-comprehension-non-fiction/block-10-non-fiction-10/lsg/subheadingpineapple1false.lsg","width":135}},{"b":{"zone":""},"lsg":{"lsg":"/../c-nateng-3-gb/topic-02a-reading-comprehension-non-fiction/block-10-non-fiction-10/lsg/subheadingpineapple2false.lsg","width":135}}]},{"trainer":"gapMulti","gapMode":"buttons","onSamePage":true,"design":"dialogue","soundMode":"b","textAlign":"left","finishButton":false,"atoms":{"b":"Here’s the page on pineapples! There’s information here about their appearance and flavour. Yum!","voice":"m6","person":{"lsg":"/../c-nateng-3-gb/topic-02a-reading-comprehension-non-fiction/block-10-non-fiction-10/lsg/mateo.lsg"}}},{"trainer":"findAll","finishButton":false,"instruction":{"speaker":true,"text":"Find the word printed in <b>bold</b>."},"soundMode":"b","atoms":{"a":"","lsg":{"lsg":"/../c-nateng-3-gb/topic-02a-reading-comprehension-non-fiction/block-10-non-fiction-10/lsg/pineappletextbold.lsg","width":400},"objects":{"class":"bromeliad","correct":tr